"},{"description":"Within the retained process-local delivery ledger, a completed duplicate returns 200 and an in-flight duplicate returns 202 without a second onEvent call. Reuse of an ID with different authenticated bytes returns 409.","id":"C2"},{"description":"Return useful failures for missing fields or invalid JSON (400), bad authentication (401), callback failure (503, permitting retry), and exhaustion when every retained entry is in flight (503).","id":"C3"},{"description":"Bound completed delivery retention by maxDeliveries. Document that eviction and restart permit reprocessing, and that durable exactly-once processing across restarts or replicas requires a persistent ledger and idempotent side effects.","id":"C4"},{"description":"Provide a usable README describing createReceiver input fields, raw Buffer handling, external secret configuration, the status-object HTTP adapter boundary, response meanings, limitations and the Node test command. The frozen eight tests must pass in the pinned isolated runner.","id":"C5"}],"deadline":1794464915,"developer":"0x9d311522821d2ae520b3ce4911cf54ff10296541","expiry":1794551315,"id":"native-c68439aa","nonce":"0xbf71324c8d72256d2716e4960d64f5beb6a0413d1f096a24bccb821d84cfc8bd","objective":"Qualify native Git escrow settlement with a small authenticated webhook receiver and an accurate process-local operating guide.","repository":"https://github.com/TS-mfon/gitcourt-native-case","runnerImage":"node@sha256:6f7b03f7c2c8e2e784dcf9295400527b9b1270fd37b7e9a7285cf83b6951452d","testsCommit":"124687ed293149ed97ced4dc2c84adee8243ded6","testsRepository":"https://github.com/TS-mfon/gitcourt-native-case","version":1},"statements":{"buyer":"This is a manually prepared native interoperability case. Judge only the frozen criteria, including the explicitly bounded process-local guarantee. It provides no autonomous-agent evidence.","developer":"I submit the signed immutable commit and its process-local receiver. Restart and eviction can reprocess a delivery; the README describes this limit. Please evaluate the actual code, frozen tests and verifier evidence."},"version":1}
